        // So steps before help: check unknown option (already done during parsing, would have exited), check host/schema forbidden, check concurrent-servers validation, check ssl-mode? But ssl-mode invalid in empty dir gave exit 0, not error, so not validated before help. So only some validations are early.

        // For simplicity, we will check host/schema forbidden now, then concurrent-servers, then proceed to help.

